{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"dongyuan-e-o067a","title":"曹操击乌丸二袁败奔辽东公孙康诱斩送首","accounts":[{"id":"dongyuan-e-o067a-account","label":"《董二袁刘传第六》正文","text":"曹操击乌丸二袁败奔辽东公孙康诱斩送首","evidence":["dongyuan-e-o067a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"进攻","evidence":["dongyuan-e-o067a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0198","role":"败走被杀","evidence":["dongyuan-e-o067a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0221","role":"败走被杀","evidence":["dongyuan-e-o067a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0247","role":"诱杀","evidence":["dongyuan-e-o067a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":207,"label":"建安十二年","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"dongyuan-y207","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"dongyuan-q-o067","basis":"建安十二年"},"evidence":["dongyuan-e-o067a-q","dongyuan-q-o067","xiahoucao-q-o006","wuzhu-q-o011","zhuge-q-o005","zhuge-q-b-40accddaa1b32119c6cb"]},"ordering_evidence":"dongyuan-e-o067a-q","source_order":[6,375,"O067a"],"related_events":[{"event":"wudi-e-o117b","type":"related","evidence":["dongyuan-e-o067a-q","wudi-e-o117b-q"]}],"order":1710},{"id":"wudi-e-o117b","title":"公孙康杀二袁及速仆丸","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o117b-account","label":"正文","text":"公孙康斩袁尚、袁熙、速仆丸等，传送首级；曹操向诸将解释撤军使双方自行相图的考虑。","evidence":["wudi-e-o117b-q"]},{"id":"gongsuntao-a-2e0c89023b6e663aa636","label":"正文","text":"建安十二年太祖征乌丸屠柳城康斩送尚首","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-cfa6d629b8b47b2f49ed"]},{"id":"yuanzhang-a-d5ecc1a128174f730729","label":"正文","text":"辽东斩送袁尚首，令三军敢有哭之者斩；田畴以尝为尚所辟往吊祭，太祖亦不问","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-34572da0cb0069de028c"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0247","role":"杀送首级","evidence":["wudi-e-o117b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0198","role":"被杀","evidence":["wudi-e-o117b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0221","role":"被杀","evidence":["wudi-e-o117b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0246","role":"被杀","evidence":["wudi-e-o117b-q"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"解释决策","evidence":["wudi-e-o117b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0243","role":"以尝为袁尚所辟，乃往吊祭","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-34572da0cb0069de028c"]}],"place":{"text":"辽东","evidence":["wudi-e-o117b-q"]},"time":{"label":"曹军自柳城回师后","year":207,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o117b-q","wudi-q-o111","wudi-q-b-fbc277caaf5ad8b958df"],"chronology":"wudi-y207","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o111","basis":"曹军自柳城回师后","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,637,"O117b"],"related_events":[{"event":"dongyuan-e-o067a","type":"related","evidence":["dongyuan-e-o067a-q","wudi-e-o117b-q"]}],"order":260}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0198","name":"袁尚","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0221","name":"袁熙","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0247","name":"公孙康","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"dongyuan-e-o067a-q","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-893eb6895390377ea179","layer":"original","quote":"十二年，太祖至辽西，击乌丸。尚、熙与乌丸，逆军战，败走奔辽东。公孙康诱斩之，送其首。﹝二﹞","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":374,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":45,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-q-o067","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-893eb6895390377ea179","layer":"original","quote":"十二年，太祖至辽西，击乌丸。尚、熙与乌丸，逆军战，败走奔辽东。公孙康诱斩之，送其首。﹝二﹞","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":374,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":45,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o117b-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-3982d5aa554a26f2c3db","layer":"original","quote":"康即斩尚、熙及速仆丸等，传其首。诸将或问：“公还而康斩送尚、熙，何也？”公曰：“彼素畏尚等，吾急之则并力，缓之则自相图；其势然也。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":636,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":14,"end":79,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o011","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-f715dc33a31e617fe160","layer":"original","quote":"十二年〖31〗，西征黄祖，虏其人民而还。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":23,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-o006","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-9b0ef46552fe5fa7e211","layer":"original","quote":"建安十二年，录惇前后功，增封邑千八百户，并前二千五百户。二十一年，从征孙权。还，使惇都督二十六军〖6〗，留居巢；赐伎乐、名倡，令曰：“魏绛以和戎之功〖7〗，犹受金石之乐〖8〗，况将军乎！”二十四年，太祖军（击破吕布军）于摩陂，召惇常与同载；特见亲重，出入卧内〖9〗。诸将莫得比也。拜前将军，﹝二﹞督诸军还寿春，徙屯召陵。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":17,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":160,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-q-b-40accddaa1b32119c6cb","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-40accddaa1b32119c6cb","layer":"modern","quote":"〖39〗尔来：从那以来。这一句总括上文，所以是从刘备三顾时的建安十二年（公元 207）算起。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":198,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-1692331886f906f52ea2","start":0,"end":46,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-q-o005","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-e33c66499df69116b2fc","layer":"original","quote":"由是先主遂诣亮；凡三往，乃见。因屏人曰〖1〗：“汉室倾颓，奸臣窃命〖2〗，主上蒙尘〖3〗。孤不度德量力〖4〗，欲信大义于天下〖5〗；而智术短浅，遂用猖獗〖6〗。至于今日，然志犹未已，君谓计将安出？”","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":30,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":99,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
